@title: form_pro_plan
@context: A sign-up on the pro plan, from Japan, without the newsletter.
@tags: form
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the sign-up form
    NAVIGATE to 'Signup'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Signup'

STEP 2: Name and email
    SET {name} = Grace Hopper
    SET {email} = grace@example.com
    USE Signup.Fill
    VERIFY 'Email' field has value 'grace@example.com'

STEP 3: Country
    SELECT 'Japan' from the 'Country' dropdown
    VERIFY 'Country' field has value 'Japan'

STEP 4: The pro plan
    CLICK the radio button for 'Pro'
    VERIFY that 'Pro' is checked
    VERIFY that 'Free' is NOT checked

STEP 5: No newsletter
    UNCHECK the checkbox for 'Newsletter'
    VERIFY that 'Newsletter' is NOT checked

STEP 6: Accept the terms
    CHECK the checkbox for 'I accept the Terms'
    VERIFY that 'Create account' is enabled

STEP 7: Create the account
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Grace Hopper! Plan: pro, country: Japan, newsletter: no' is present

DONE.
